So my candidate input should be: [4 bytes opts][4 bytes maxAlloc][HTML doc bytes].

The HTML doc needs to trigger htmlParseHTMLAttribute with the uninitialized read. To trigger the grow-failure path, I need maxAlloc to be small enough to cause xmlParserGrow to fail at the right moment, but large enough that the parser gets far enough to enter htmlParseHTMLAttribute.

