OK let me stop theorizing and actually build + test. Let me install clang.

Actually, before that — let me reconsider the simplest possible trigger that the oss-fuzz testcase likely is. The oss-fuzz id 42522440. These testcases are usually small. The input format is [4 opts][4 maxAlloc][doc]. 

Given the bug needs grow failure, maxAlloc must be tuned. But actually — maybe the bug triggers WITHOUT memory pressure via the push parser path! The html.c harness ALSO runs a push parser:

